{"id":"belegt","lemma":"belegt","pos":"adj","rank":4518,"glosses":["documented; proven; attested","occupied, taken","plated, coated"],"ipa":"/bəˈleːkt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f9/De-belegt.ogg/De-belegt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Alle Zimmer sind belegt.","en":"All the rooms are taken.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759897","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"room"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Der Platz ist nicht belegt.","en":"This seat isn't taken.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"square, plaza, piazza"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Alle guten Plätze waren bereits belegt.","en":"All the good seats were already taken.","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"square, plaza, piazza","l":"Platz"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"already"},null]},{"text":"Haben Sie schon einmal einen Onlinekurs belegt?","en":"Have you ever taken an online class?","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"once, one time"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,null]},{"text":"Viele Krankenwagen waren mit Schussopfern belegt.","en":"There were many ambulances filled with gunshot victims.","words":[{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"ambulance"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"with"},null,null]}]}